            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of Vibrio splendidus DSM 19640.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01368-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01368-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Here, we present the draft genome sequence of Vibrio splendidus type strain DSM 19640. V. splendidus is an abundant species among coastal vibrioplankton. The assembly resulted in a 5,729,362-bp draft genome with 5,032 protein-coding sequences, 6 rRNAs, and 117 tRNAs.</AbstractText>
